### Reviewer worklist: COPY the "id" of the PA-CPAP-002 request
GET {{base}}/um/prior-auth

### Reviewer decides: PASTE the id in place of PASTE-ID-HERE -> A3 denied with reason
POST {{base}}/um/prior-auth/PASTE-ID-HERE/items/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "A3", "reasonText": "AHI below 15 without qualifying comorbidity" }

